# The image holds what the application runs, and nothing else: every file
# is left out but those listed with "!" below. An env file, a database, or
# a key next to the Dockerfile never goes in, whatever its name. Add a
# "!" line for each directory of your own the application reads (such as
# LOCALE_PATHS outside src/). Deployments set {{ prefix }}* themselves.
*
!manage.py
!pyproject.toml
!src/
!migrations/

# Never, even inside those.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/secrets/
**/*.sqlite3
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
